### IntelliJ IDEA ###
.idea
*.iws
*.iml
*.ipr
out/
!**/src/main/**/out/
!**/src/test/**/out/

### NetBeans ###
/nbproject/private/
/build/
/nbbuild/
/dist/
/nbdist/
/nbactions.xml
/nb-configuration.xml
%USERPROFILE%/.netbeans/

### VS Code / Cursor ###
.vscode/

### OS / Environment ###
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.log
*.env
application-local.yml
application-secret.yml
EOF